  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 102.02 \"Commission\" means \"commission\" as defined in RSA 275-C:1, I, namely, \"the governor's commission on disability.\"\n\nSource. #7634, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10338, eff 5-17-13",
